{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535350/extras/DemoBanner.png?t=1741965265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT THIS DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Mistaken Demo</strong> offers a <strong>3\u20135 hour survival experience</strong>, giving you a taste of the world swallowed by mist. <strong>Create your character, choose your origin, and carve your own path.</strong> Will you scavenge, build, or fight your way to survival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s Included in the Demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>3\u20135 hours of gameplay</strong> \u2013 explore, adapt, and survive.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Create your character</strong> and select an <strong>Origin</strong> that shapes your abilities and playstyle.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Scavenge for resources</strong> to craft weapons, tools, and gear and hope for lucky stat rolls.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Build shelter</strong> to fortify yourself against the lurking horrors.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Face the Mistaken</strong> in intense combat and challenge <strong>a selection of powerful bosses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just the beginning\u2014<strong>more content, weapons, and challenges await in the full game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535350/extras/LibraryLogoTrimmed.png?t=1741965265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535350?t=1741965265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741